p=Path('docs/DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md');s=p.read_text(encoding='utf-8');s+='''
## Studio 0.3 and the Arabic handbooks

app/studio.py adds the compact navigation, original vector icons, default dark palette, dashboard workflow, native protocol tabs and help entry points. The underlying scientific controls and callbacks remain connected through the existing RedesignMixin and BaseWindow. Table empty states are explicit. The app sets the Windows AppUserModelID before QApplication, bundles a multi-size ICO in the PE resources and ships a shortcut with IconLocation pointing at the same asset.

The Arabic practical and implementation handbooks are generated by tools/build_arabic_guides.py as RTL Word documents with native Office Math and actual screenshots. LibreOffice renders the saved DOCX to PDF, then all pages are inspected. They document operating steps and the actual code/algorithms separately. Packaging includes the guides; they are copied beside the executable in Documentation.

Duplicate source composition entries now invalidate only the affected oil-profile index with an explicit review warning. They are neither deleted nor double-weighted, and other profiles remain rankable. This change preserves the original source records.
''';p.write_text(s,encoding='utf-8')
